  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/_processed_/4/e/csm_AMS-0416-03_F_12e39f48d3.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 72 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/aktorik/schaltaktoren/schaltaktor-ams-mit-strommessung-serie-03.html</informations>
